Package: scDARI
Title: A Discrete Dynamical Model for Activating Gene Regulatory Network Inference from scRNA-seq Data
Version: 1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Taihang", family = "Huang", email = "huangtaihang@buaa.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the scDARI algorithm, a novel method for predicting Gene Regulatory Networks (GRNs) from scRNA-seq data and by modeling their discrete evolutionary dynamics along a pseudotemporal trajectory. This package provides a comprehensive toolkit for reconstructing developmental or disease progression pathways from transcriptomics snapshots.
